1 _OID e6f7bad1-fcf5-4fd8-b71b-57f47df0a2c2
1 DATE 8/21/2013
1 PLAC Old Meeting House; now next to First Presbyterian Church, Southold, Long Island, NY
1 _DSCR John Youngs
2 CONT 
2 CONT Under this tablet is the original brownstone slab with the following inscription
2 CONT 
2 CONT Mr John Youngs, MINISTER OF THE WORD
2 CONT AND FIRST SETTLER OF THECHURH OF CHRIST IN SOUTHOLD ON LONG ISLAND. 
2 CONT DECEASED THE 24of February in the years of our lord 1671-2 AND OF HIS AGE 74
2 CONT 
2 CONT Here lies the an whose doctrine, life, well knowen did shew He daughter Christ's Honor not His own In weakness sown, in power raisd shall be by Christ from death to life eternally
2 CONT 
2 CONT 
